comments[25]:
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T12:57:31.272Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Companion specification: pm-cli-website-zchz (read only). Local package only; release held for maintainer approval. Use native Knowledge items, registered fields, certified reads, host token estimation and process-safe memory mutation locking."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T13:08:07.483Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Implementation covers all eight commands and shared SDK entry points. Embedded SDK generic field writes require active extension registration; native registered schema options through client.run preserve in-process operation without extension recursion. Source copy remains private and external. Tests exercise real trackers, full host output and independent process recallers."
    edited_at: "2026-10-19T19:27:59.470Z"
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T13:24:52.194Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Packed distribution acceptance passed for both npm/npx and Bun/bunx: 2 tests passed. The first private-copy round trip imported 281 files and exported all 281 byte-identically; re-import reported 281 unchanged and zero writes. Final lexical ranking and native semantic edit safeguards are being rechecked before final acceptance."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T13:32:38.899Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "All six feature-linked pm test commands passed. Baseline revert proof run after restoring all sources: 3 passed, zero failed. Production audit, duplication and docstrings are clean in preliminary checks. Full isolated npm and Bun release gates follow on the implementation commit."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T13:41:11.116Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Accepted private-copy aggregate: 281 imported; re-import 281 unchanged, zero created or updated; 281 exports byte-identical by recursive diff. Index 1498 of 1500 estimated tokens, 248 omitted. Recall token/reference-rank pairs in the requested query order: 759/1, 752/1, 751/omitted-from-three, 737/1, 738/3. Verification checked 280 facts: 198 stale, failing claims file=377 flag=249 symbol=34. Consolidation dry run: merge=0 supersedes=1 archive=189; no apply. Private scratch data removed."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T13:41:15.027Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Both isolated release gates passed on the completed implementation: npm run release:check and bun run release:check, each 12 stages, 79 unit/tooling tests and 2 packed consumers, zero failed. Coverage across all 19 authored source files: 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines (1440/1440 statements and lines, 673/673 branches, 72/72 functions). Docstrings 65 declarations; duplication zero; production vulnerabilities zero; 42 packed files all allowlisted. Fresh no-local clone: health 10 checks and validate 10 checks, zero warnings. Four behavioral revert proofs failed under reversion and passed after restoration."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T13:55:58.723Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Round two: conservative evidence classification across bounded repeated roots, frontmatter identity and alias links, compact ranked recall plus full get, aggregate privacy diagnostics, descriptive help and age-gated archival. Local-only work; synthetic regressions and private aggregate proof before both release gates."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T14:32:17.864Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Isolated npm release gate passed: 88 tests, 0 failures, 100% statements/branches/functions/lines across 19 configured source files, zero production vulnerabilities, zero duplication, 2 packed consumers accepted through npx and bunx including detailed import help, repeated verification roots, nested basename evidence and full get. Bun release gate pending. Linked round-two regression runner passed 9/9."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T14:38:35.200Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Both final release gates passed in isolated HOME/Git identity environments: npm run release:check and bun run release:check each ran 88 tests with zero failures/skips plus 2 packed npx/bunx consumers. Both report 100% statement, branch, function and line coverage across all 19 configured source files; zero production vulnerabilities; zero duplication; 42 allowlisted packed files. Three behavioral revert proofs and the 9/9 linked regression runner are recorded. All private proof artifacts deleted. Local-only review; no push or repository creation."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T15:52:22.211Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Review round 1: verified all 17 unresolved threads at 3df1e75. Plan bounded in-process verification, raw-field privacy, semantic timestamps, recoverable consolidation, current atomic exports, attribution and regression proofs. No private source data is required."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T16:02:15.658Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Implemented all 17 thread fixes and both orchestrator findings. Verification streams indexed regular files with 64 MiB run and 8 MiB file caps, 100000 entries per root, conservative refusals, no rg dependency. Content age uses memory_changed_at with created_at fallback. Merge receipts survive failures; exports stage then rename and regenerate stale indexes. SDK gap: the injected host client asserts pm-extension without an author flag; a native dispatcher adapter clears that fallback and preserves the documented author chain. Focused attribution, 100k URL and bounded streaming regressions pass."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T16:14:09.979Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Behavioral revert proof ledger: 22 targeted regressions fail with the corresponding behavior reverted and pass after restoration. Cases cover URL complexity, the fresh README invocation, matching subjects, surviving merge targets, durable merge receipts, raw-field privacy, canceled slug reuse, semantic age, canceled imports, current export paths/indexes, atomic refusal/failure cleanup, excluded exported evidence, safe gh arguments, reverse collisions, prepare environment precedence, portable null devices, archive/artifact assertions, independent inventory/text search without rg, SDK author precedence, root-remedy text, and formatting-only import timestamps. The 100k adversarial scan runs in a child process; a two-second scan deadline kills the reverted regex, while the fixed scan stays below 500 ms. Synthetic OS hooks prove devNull portability. Restored regression baselines pass; the linked pm runner passed 19 of 19. Full npm execution passed 106 of 106 tests; the first strict coverage attempt exposed two missing export destination branches, now covered by empty-target publication and nonempty-target refusal scenarios. No thresholds changed."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T16:28:52.004Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Source head 0748393 is pushed to PR 1. Isolated npm and fresh-clone Bun each passed 106 tests with zero failures or skips and all four coverage thresholds at 100 percent across 19 sources. npm coverage counts: 1796 of 1796 statements and lines, 1048 of 1048 branches, 93 of 93 functions. Both production audits are clean; both packed npx/bunx consumer gates remain in progress. The GitHub CodeQL security check is green; the analysis workflow and Node matrix are queued. Separate development-only advisory follow-up: pm-memory-eafx."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T16:35:11.457Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Both complete release gates passed at source head 0748393: npm run release:check and bun run release:check, each 12 stages, 106 of 106 unit/tooling tests, zero failures/skips, plus 2 of 2 real packed npx/bunx consumers. Coverage is 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines over all 19 configured sources: 1796 statements/lines, 1048 branches and 93 functions. Docstrings cover 78 declarations; duplication is zero; production vulnerabilities are zero; all 42 packed files are allowlisted. A fresh no-local clone passed health 10 of 10 with zero warnings. Validate exited successfully with 9 checks ok and one local test-trust warning category caused by the temporary review branch name; final branch validation will be checked separately. All 22 behavior reversions failed the intended regression, with restored baselines passing; the linked pm runner passed 19 of 19. SDK gap: the injected host client supplies pm-extension when no flag author exists; the adapter clears that fallback while preserving native dispatch. No private source data was read or copied. GitHub currently reports an Actions scheduling incident; Node 22 is green and Node 26 is running on the implementation head. CodeQL security is green; its workflow remains queued. Tracker receipts are finalized without closing items."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T19:27:19.070Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "PR 1 follow-up review: all 10 unresolved threads and every comment fetched without pagination omissions at 325d45d; latest CodeRabbit review has no outside-diff findings. Main is already an ancestor; health passes 10 checks without pending receipts. Validated scope: tracker command count, supersession archive conflict and idempotence, linear query scoring, recall exhaustion preflight, nested export parents and permissions, portable index links, last-line claim fences and raced symlink evidence. Use synthetic real trackers, per-function behavioral revert proofs and both unchanged release gates."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T19:36:33.262Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Behavioral revert ledger for the 10 unresolved PR 1 threads: execute node --test --test-name-pattern=\"<pattern>\" test/review-followup.test.ts in an isolated synthetic package copy, restoring only each corresponding function from 325d45d while retaining required imports. Tracker-count reversion restores the previous item snapshot. Results: PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uEJT8 -> review tracker (1 failure); PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uEJUH and PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uEJUS -> proposals / supersession (2 failures); PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uEJUf -> scored / ranking query (1); PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uEJUq -> recall / recall preflights (1); PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uEJVD and PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uEJWH -> publish / export creates nested and export publishes normal (2); PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uEJWT -> exportDir and currentIndex reverted separately / export index escapes (1 failure each); PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uEJWs -> uncertainSentence / last-line file (1); PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uEJXB -> inventory / inventory rechecks (1), searchClaims / text evidence (2). Total: 10 mutation runs, 13 intended assertion failures, no missing-import or syntax failures. Tests import TypeScript directly; no distribution rebuild is needed. Restored full regression baseline and both release gates are still running."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T19:36:43.057Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: The first linked runner attempt reached its 120-second default timeout with zero assertion failures; the command timeout is now 600 seconds and the mandatory pm test run is being repeated. No thresholds changed. Separate follow-up pm-memory-c3gv records the later maintainer concern on already-resolved thread PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6t_o9_; it is outside this round of 10 unresolved requests and code inspection confirms the missing receipt revision guard. Existing development-only dependency follow-up pm-memory-eafx is unchanged.
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T19:39:05.638Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Restored revert-proof baseline passed 12 of 12 tests with zero failures or skips; the mandatory linked pm runner also passed 12 of 12 after its timeout increase. The first full npm gate exposed an existing index-compatibility assertion: simple generated link destinations must retain their established plain syntax. Generation now angle-delimits only names requiring URI encoding, and the prior index regression plus the new escaped-name round trip are being rechecked before restarting both full gates. The superseded gate was stopped after identifying that failure; it is not counted as passing."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T19:57:54.234Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Final guard review found an introduced edge case before push: skipping a non-regular verification root could yield an empty inventory and falsely mark an existing contextual symbol stale. inventory now refuses such a root explicitly. The regression first verifies real source evidence, then asserts that a symlink root refuses without changing durable tracker bytes. The related four inventory/text guards passed. Both superseded release runs passed 118 tests and full four-dimension coverage, but were stopped before packed acceptance completed; neither is claimed as a full release-gate pass. Full gates will be rerun on the final guard source."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T19:58:34.257Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Final causal checks: after preserving simple-link compatibility, reverting exportDir and currentIndex separately to 325d45d each failed the escaped-index regression; restoration passed. The additional symlink-root regression fails when only inventory is reverted to d1a70f0 and passes after restoration, including a real verified memory whose durable bytes must stay unchanged on refusal. This supplements the initial 10 mutation runs and their 13 intended assertion failures. No private corpus, SDK mocks, missing-import failures or syntax failures were involved."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T20:01:02.502Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: The identity gate flagged the literal opening delimiter of a test regex followed by root as an absolute-home prefix. The assertions now match the complete Verification root error text. This changes no production behavior or policy threshold. The unpublished local source commit is amended to avoid preserving the false-positive line in commit ancestry; every existing pm history record remains unchanged.
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T20:18:22.419Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Both complete release gates passed at implementation head f261a9f in isolated HOME and Git identity environments: npm run release:check and bun run release:check each completed all 12 stages, 119 of 119 unit/tooling tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations, and 2 of 2 real packed npx/bunx consumers. All 19 configured sources meet unchanged 100 percent statement, branch, function and line thresholds: 1818 statements and lines, 1083 branches, 93 functions. Docstrings cover 79 declarations; duplication is zero; production vulnerabilities are zero; all 42 packed files are allowlisted. The final linked pm runner passed 13 of 13 regressions. Revert evidence maps all 10 unresolved threads, with additional final export and root-refusal checks recorded above; restored baselines pass. Fresh-clone health passed 10 of 10 checks with zero warnings. Implementation commits are d1a70f0 and f261a9f. No private memory corpus was read or copied. Open follow-ups are pm-memory-c3gv for the separate already-resolved-thread receipt revision concern and the unchanged pm-memory-eafx development-only advisory. Thread replies, resolution, merging and releases are held; remote CI will be checked after pushing the completion receipt."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T20:41:01.122Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "PR 1 review round: fetched all review threads and every comment (no remaining pagination), and read the latest nonempty CodeRabbit review body; no outside-diff findings in that review. Five unresolved threads verified as valid: competing merge/supersedes actions, unchanged remember state, case-folded export collisions, verification lock/network responsiveness, and inherited Git fixture environment. Remote head is current and contains main; health is clean and current CI has no failures. Plan: real-tracker regressions and individual behavioral reverts, unchanged npm and Bun release gates, isolated identity, clean-clone health, explicit code plus tracker commit and push. Existing follow-ups remain separate."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T20:54:05.368Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "PR 1 revert evidence: six isolated mutations each exited 1 with ERR_ASSERTION; current tests were retained and only relevant implementation functions reverted against the prior remote head. In test/review-r4.test.ts: PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uGDKI reverted proposals with node --test --test-name-pattern=\"competing merge\"; competing proposals now cross the documented 0.82 threshold. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uGDKS reverted remember with --test-name-pattern=\"unchanged remember\" and failed CRLF import state/age preservation. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uGDKj reverted exportDir with --test-name-pattern=\"export rejects reserved\" and failed the typed collision refusal. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uGDKx reverted verify with --test-name-pattern=\"network verification releases\" and failed writer completion during a pending real HTTP response; checkClaim separately reverted with --test-name-pattern=\"network evidence subprocesses\" failed event-loop responsiveness. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6uGDK6 reverted checkout, prepare and registeredDrivers in test/prepare-merge-driver.test.ts with node --test --test-name-pattern=\"fixture Git commands ignore\" and failed synthetic fixture driver registration under poisoned Git overrides. Every mutation was restored. The linked pm runner passed 16 of 16 final regressions before this mutation series. An earlier full run exposed only a short timing deadline in the new test; the revised regression controls a real HTTP response and bounds writer completion below its lock wait. That run measured all coverage dimensions at 100 percent. Unchanged release gates follow; fixtures contain no private corpus and use real SDK trackers."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T21:03:52.955Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Final local acceptance for PR 1 at implementation commit a5262d2: npm run release:check and bun run release:check both passed all 12 stages under isolated HOME and Git identity settings. Each passed 125 of 125 unit/tooling tests and 2 of 2 real packed npm/Bun consumers, with zero failures, skips or cancellations. All 19 configured sources retain unchanged 100 percent statement, branch, function and line thresholds: 1839 statements/lines, 1109 branches and 94 functions. All 79 declarations are documented; duplication is zero; production vulnerabilities are zero; all 42 packed files are allowlisted. The linked pm runner passed 16 of 16 regressions; six behavioral revert runs covering the five valid unresolved threads each produced an intended assertion failure and every function was restored. Independent no-local clone strict health passed all 10 checks with zero warnings. No finding was refused. No private corpus was read or copied, no dependency pins/workflows/installer template/thresholds changed, and no new pm CLI or SDK defect was encountered. Existing open follow-ups pm-memory-c3gv and pm-memory-eafx remain separate. This item stays in progress for orchestrator verification; thread replies, thread resolution, PR merge and release are held. Remote CI will be verified on the pushed completion head."
